{"updated":"2026-09-19T06:06:41.787Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Trump’s threats to demolish Kennedy Center sparks protest. Elsewhere, trump says he is banning CNN and Politico from White House. And brazilian police capture suspected serial killer disguised as a woman. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 0.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 52 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.5 near Kermadec Islands region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.57,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.81,0.91,1.08,1.32,1.44,1.49,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.71,1.75,1.83,1.89,1.94,1.97,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.14,2.18,2.24,2.29,2.32,2.37,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.54,2.6,2.66,2.73,2.84,2.96,3.11,3.13,3.18,3.22,3.27,3.32,3.38,3.5,3.59,3.65,3.71,3.76,3.82,3.87,3.91,3.96,3.98,4.02,4.06,4.09,4.11,4.13,4.19,4.24,4.33,4.4,4.47,4.55,4.61,4.72,4.76,4.82,4.84,4.89,5,5.16,5.31,5.75,5.84,5.9,5.94,6,6.05,6.11,6.13,6.17,6.19,6.25,6.3,6.35,6.4,6.47,6.51,6.57,6.61,6.64,6.71,6.75,6.82,6.9,6.95,7.01,7.06,7.11,7.15,7.21,7.25,7.3,7.35,7.4,7.44,7.5,7.56,7.62,7.66,7.73,7.79,7.86,7.94,8.01,8.26,8.35,8.44,8.5,8.56,8.64,8.68,8.73,8.79,8.85,8.93,9.01,9.13,9.2,9.31,9.44,9.95,10.07,10.13,10.19,10.25,10.29,10.34,10.38,10.44,10.56,10.61,10.7,10.79,10.84,10.89,10.94,10.99,11.05,11.1,11.16,11.21,11.26,11.33,11.35,11.38,11.45,11.49,11.53,11.6,11.66,11.74,11.77,11.83,11.88,11.91,11.95,12.03,12.15,12.33,12.57,12.63,12.68,12.72,12.76,12.83,12.86,12.91,12.97,13.02,13.07,13.13,13.2,13.29,13.35,13.39,13.42,13.46,13.49,13.55,13.57,13.63,13.69,13.75,13.79